<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30851" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nētum</span></b> , i, n.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city in
				Sicily, south-west of Syracuse</i>, now <i>Noto
				Vecchio</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 26, § 59</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Sil.
				14, 268</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nētī-nenses</span></b> ,
			ĭum, m., <i>the
				inhabitants of Netum</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 2, 65, §
			126</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nētīni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Netum</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 5, 22, §
		56</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
